\section{Capability Differentiation}

\begin{table}[ht!]
\caption{Capability positioning based on reviewed public materials. Typical-approach entries summarize common documented emphases and do not prove absence of unlisted features.}
\label{tab:capability_differentiation}
\scriptsize
\centering
\setlength{\tabcolsep}{2.5pt}
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.08}
\begin{tabular}{@{}L{2.0cm} L{2.4cm} L{2.8cm} L{3.1cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{Capability} & \textbf{Function} & \textbf{Typical approaches} & \textbf{SciForge differentiation} \\
\midrule
Model Router
& Unified provider and model management
& Single-provider lock-in or manual switching
& Provider-agnostic routing across OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, and local models with cost-aware fallback chains; localizable deployment preserves data sovereignty \\
Scientific Pipeline
& Convert scientific objects into agent-readable evidence
& Raw scientific text input or manual preprocessing
& Translate-then-reason with four C2S modality experts (protein, structure, molecule, single-cell); unrecognized formats fail closed with diagnostics \\
Agent Runtime
& Coordinate agents, tools, commands, and long tasks
& Single-session chat with limited delegation
& Research-aware runtime with sub-agent delegation, MCP workers, plan recovery, and cross-session task continuation \\
Workflow Engine
& Automate repeatable research protocols
& Scripts, cron jobs, and manual runbooks
& DAG-based workflows combining code, agent, tool, schedule, event, and approval nodes; natively integrated with the agent runtime \\
Research Memory
& Preserve project state across sessions
& Chat history or document RAG
& Structured Project DAG with confidence-tagged, timestamped records; typed goals and formal decisions persist as first-class DAG nodes \\
Evidence Governance
& Connect claims, evidence, audit findings, and approvals
& Outputs detached from data, scripts, and review history
& Thread-scoped Evidence DAGs with automatic provenance capture; scheduled audit runs; quality gates and configurable approval boundaries \\
Research Capability Patterns
& Expose human judgment points
& Generic chat and file views
& Human-in-the-loop judgment patterns (artifact review, approval, visual inspection) grounded in Evidence DAGs and audit records \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{table}
